        {
          "_name": "content5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor"
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>Article Title</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Enter your subtitle here\n                </h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">The Energy Revolution System is presented as a renewable energy solution designed to help homeowners and small businesses explore alternatives to conventional electricity. By focusing on accessible energy-generation methods, it aims to make sustainable living more approachable for people who want to manage their electricity expenses and reduce their dependence on the traditional power grid.<br><br>At its core, the Energy Revolution System focuses on using renewable resources, such as sunlight and wind, to generate usable electricity. For households dealing with rising utility costs, exploring alternative energy options may offer an opportunity to improve energy efficiency, manage expenses, and reduce reliance on fossil-fuel-based electricity.<br><br>Unlike some traditional energy projects that may require professional installation and significant upfront investment, the Energy Revolution System is presented as a DIY-friendly option for people interested in learning about alternative energy. Its emphasis on straightforward instructions is intended to help users understand the process and explore whether this approach fits their household or small-business needs.<br><br>Key Features of the Energy Revolution System<br><br>✅ Easy-to-Follow Instructions: The system is designed to make the process more accessible to beginners, helping users understand the setup without requiring advanced technical knowledge.<br><br>✅ Renewable Energy Approach: It focuses on renewable energy concepts, including solar and wind power, that can help users explore cleaner alternatives to conventional electricity.<br><br>✅ Potential Energy Cost Savings: By exploring alternative electricity-generation methods, users may be able to reduce some of their dependence on grid electricity. Actual savings depend on the setup, energy usage, local conditions, and installation costs.<br><br>✅ Environmentally Conscious Living: Renewable energy can help reduce reliance on fossil fuels, making it an option worth considering for people interested in a more sustainable lifestyle.<br><br>The Energy Revolution System is designed for people who want to take a more active role in understanding their energy needs. If your goal is to explore DIY energy solutions, learn about renewable power, and investigate potential ways to manage household electricity costs, this system may be worth researching. Before getting started, review the instructions, equipment requirements, safety considerations, and realistic performance expectations to determine whether it suits your situation.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
