          "_name": "image01",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"image01\" group=\"Image & Video\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n                    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"7\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n      <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n    </fieldset>\n    <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"image-wrapper mb-4\">\n          <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/664eb88de9b0375f5d75125a-graph-p-1080-1080x619.webp\" alt=\"graph\">\n        </div>\n        <h4 class=\"mbr-description mbr-fonts-style mb-3 align-center\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-description\">\n          <b>Stitching dreams, one thread at a time.</b>\n        </h4>\n        <p class=\"mbr-description mbr-fonts-style mb-0 align-center\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-description\">\n          Unleash your creativity and sew your way to endless possibilities.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "uuVD9SD7GZ",
          "_anchor": "image01-3o",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "_name": "content5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>Article Title</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Enter your subtitle here\n                </h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">With electricity costs putting increasing pressure on household budgets, many homeowners are exploring ways to manage their energy consumption and make more sustainable choices. The Energy Revolution System is presented as an option for people interested in learning about alternative energy solutions, reducing their reliance on conventional electricity, and taking a more active role in their energy needs.<br><br>Whether your priority is managing utility expenses, exploring renewable energy, or preparing for potential power interruptions, understanding the possible benefits of the Energy Revolution System can help you decide whether it fits your goals.<br><br><b>1. Explore Potential Savings on Electricity Bills</b><br><br>One of the main reasons people consider alternative energy solutions is the possibility of reducing their monthly electricity expenses. Generating some of your own electricity may reduce the amount of power you need to purchase from your utility provider.<br><br>The Energy Revolution System is aimed at people interested in exploring this approach. However, actual savings depend on your energy consumption, equipment requirements, local conditions, and the cost of setting up and operating the system.<br><br><b>2. Take a Step Toward Greater Energy Independence</b><br><br>Depending entirely on the traditional power grid can leave households exposed to utility price increases and unexpected outages. Exploring alternative energy sources may help you diversify how your household obtains electricity.<br><br>The Energy Revolution System introduces an approach to understanding and exploring DIY energy generation. Keep in mind that maintaining power during an outage generally requires suitable equipment, such as compatible energy storage and backup components. Energy independence will depend on the system you build and its capabilities.<br><br><b>3. Make More Environmentally Conscious Choices</b><br><br>For people looking to reduce their environmental impact, renewable energy offers an alternative worth exploring. Solar and wind power can generate electricity without directly burning fossil fuels during operation.<br><br>By learning more about renewable energy through the Energy Revolution System, you can explore ways to make energy use more sustainable. The environmental benefits will depend on the equipment, energy source, and electricity-generation method you ultimately use.<br><br><b>4. Explore Potential Benefits for Your Property</b><br><br>Energy efficiency and renewable energy features can be attractive to prospective homebuyers. Depending on the installation, local market conditions, and documented energy savings, a suitable renewable energy system may contribute to a property's appeal.<br><br>The Energy Revolution System may interest homeowners who want to investigate alternative energy projects. However, any effect on property value will depend on the quality, safety, compliance, and practical value of the completed installation. An increase in resale value is not guaranteed.<br><br><b>5. Keep Up With the Shift Toward Renewable Energy</b><br><br>Renewable energy is becoming an increasingly important part of discussions about household electricity, energy efficiency, and long-term sustainability. Learning about alternative energy methods can help you better understand your options and make more informed decisions.<br><br>The Energy Revolution System is presented as an accessible starting point for people interested in exploring DIY energy concepts. It may be worth considering if you want to learn more about alternative power solutions before deciding whether a larger renewable energy investment makes sense for your needs.<br><br><b>6. Consider a DIY-Friendly Approach to Energy</b><br><br>Traditional renewable energy installations can involve equipment selection, installation expenses, inspections, and ongoing maintenance. For beginners, understanding these requirements before investing can make the decision-making process easier.<br><br>The Energy Revolution System emphasizes an approachable, instruction-based format. Nevertheless, maintenance requirements will depend on the actual equipment used, and electrical systems may require professional installation or inspection to meet applicable safety standards.<br><br><b>7. Explore a More Accessible Way to Learn About Energy Generation</b><br><br>Getting started with renewable energy can seem complicated when you are unfamiliar with electrical equipment and installation requirements. A clearly organized guide may help you understand the basic concepts and identify the steps involved in exploring a DIY energy project.<br><br>The Energy Revolution System is intended to make the learning process more approachable. Before beginning, review the instructions, required materials, estimated costs, and safety precautions so you can determine whether the project is suitable for your experience level and energy needs.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
