        {
          "_name": "content5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>Article Title</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Enter your subtitle here\n                </h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">The Energy Revolution System is presented as a solution for people interested in exploring alternative energy generation and taking a more active role in managing their electricity needs. Its core appeal is the idea of making renewable energy concepts easier to understand, helping users explore potential ways to manage utility expenses and reduce their dependence on conventional power sources.<br><br>Before purchasing, it's important to review exactly what the program provides and whether physical equipment is included. The following components are described in the supplied product information; confirm their availability and specifications on the official website before making a purchase.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor"
          },
          "_cid": "uuRXjg2ZsG",
          "_anchor": "content5-3a",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "_name": "content9",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content9\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stylized Counters\" name=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Square Counters\" name=\"squareCounters\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#b17643\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">Here's What the Energy Revolution System Claims to Cover</h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                    <ol>\n                        <li><span style=\"font-size: 22.544px;\"><b>High-Efficiency Solar Panels : </b>Solar panels use sunlight to generate electricity, making them a popular option for households exploring renewable energy. The system's description highlights solar power as a potential way to supplement conventional&nbsp;</span></li><li><b>Wind Turbines :</b>&nbsp;Wind turbines generate electricity from moving air and may complement solar power in suitable locations. Their effectiveness depends on local wind conditions, turbine capacity, placement, and installation requirements. Combining renewable sources may offer additional flexibility, but continuous electricity generation is not guaranteed.</li><li><b>Energy Storage Battery :</b>&nbsp;Energy storage can help users save electricity generated earlier for use when solar or wind output is limited. A compatible battery may provide greater flexibility, depending on its capacity and the household's energy demands. Check whether battery equipment is included or must be purchased separately.</li><li><b>User-Friendly Installation Guidance :</b>&nbsp;A straightforward installation guide can help beginners understand the basic steps involved in exploring an alternative energy project. However, the materials provided should be reviewed carefully to determine whether they cover equipment setup, wiring, safety requirements, and any need for qualified professional assistance.</li><li><b>Smart Energy Management :</b>&nbsp;Energy monitoring tools can help users understand electricity production and consumption. The product description refers to smart energy management, but you should verify whether this involves actual monitoring hardware, software, or instructional material before assuming real-time monitoring is included.</li><li><b>Eco-Conscious Design Considerations&nbsp;:</b>&nbsp;Renewable energy can support more sustainable electricity generation by reducing reliance on fossil-fuel-based power. The overall environmental impact depends on the equipment, materials, manufacturing, operating conditions, and system lifespan.</li><li><b>Step-by-Step Instructions and Support :</b>&nbsp;Clear instructions can make a DIY energy project easier to understand, especially for people with limited technical experience. The product description also mentions customer support. Before ordering, check the exact support options, response arrangements, and scope of assistance available to customers.</li></ol><div>With these features and concepts, the Energy Revolution System is presented as an option for people interested in learning about alternative electricity generation and exploring potential energy savings. Before purchasing, verify the complete deliverables, physical equipment requirements, total setup costs, and safety considerations to ensure the system matches your expectations.</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".counter-container": {
              "ol": {
                "margin-bottom": "0",
                "li": {
                  "margin-bottom": "1rem"
                },
                "& when (@stylizedCounters)": {
                  "counter-reset": "myCounter",
                  "li": {
                    "list-style": "none",
                    "padding-left": "1rem",
                    "position": "relative",
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-40px",
                      "margin-top": "5px",
                      "counter-increment": "myCounter",
                      "content": "counter(myCounter)",
                      "line-height": "40px",
                      "transition": "all .2s",
                      "color": "contrast(@iconColor)",
                      "background": "@iconColor",
                      "width": "40px",
                      "height": "40px",
                      "border-radius": "50%",
                      "display": "flex",
                      "align-items": "center",
                      "justify-content": "center",
                      "& when (@squareCounters)": {
                        "border-radius": "0"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
