          "_name": "content4",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content4\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"12\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#b17643\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>Benefits of the Energy Revolution System</b></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    You can arrange your articles with the Mobirise website design software.\n                </h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "content4-l",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "tLFvtOWc4e",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "_name": "content8",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content8\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"11\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stylized\" name=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Mark\" name=\"mark\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <select title=\"Type\" name=\"countersType\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n            <option value=\"default\">Ð¡ircle Fill</option>\n            <option value=\"circle\">Circle</option>\n            <option value=\"square\" selected>Square</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#b17643\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">The Energy Revolution System is designed for people who want to explore renewable energy, understand their electricity usage, and look for practical ways to manage household energy expenses. By introducing concepts such as solar power, wind energy, and energy storage, it aims to make alternative energy solutions more approachable.<div><br></div><div>Here are the key potential benefits to consider before deciding whether the Energy Revolution System is right for you.</div><div><br></div><div><b>1. Potential Savings on Electricity Costs</b></div><div><br></div><div>One of the main reasons homeowners explore renewable energy is the possibility of reducing their dependence on electricity purchased from utility providers. Generating some of your own electricity may help lower your monthly energy expenses over time.</div><div><br></div><div>With the Energy Revolution System, users can explore alternative energy concepts and learn about potential ways to manage power consumption. Actual savings depend on equipment costs, energy production, household usage, and local electricity rates.</div><div><br></div><div><b>2. A More Environmentally Conscious Lifestyle</b></div><div><br></div><div>Renewable energy can help reduce dependence on fossil fuels and support more sustainable electricity generation. Solar and wind technologies generate electricity without directly burning fossil fuels during operation.</div><div><br></div><div>For people who want to make more environmentally conscious choices, learning about renewable energy through the Energy Revolution System may be a useful starting point. The overall environmental impact will depend on the equipment and energy sources used.</div><div><br></div><div><b>3. Greater Control Over Your Energy Needs</b></div><div><br></div><div>Rising electricity prices and unexpected outages can make households consider alternative energy options. Generating electricity from renewable sources may provide another way to meet some of your energy needs.</div><div><br></div><div>The Energy Revolution System introduces concepts related to alternative power generation. However, reducing grid dependence or maintaining electricity during an outage requires an appropriately configured system with sufficient generation capacity and, where needed, compatible energy storage.</div><div><br></div><div><b>4. An Accessible Introduction to Renewable Energy</b></div><div><br></div><div>Getting started with alternative energy can seem complicated, particularly for people without previous technical experience. Clear instructions and an organized learning process can help beginners understand the basic concepts involved.</div><div><br></div><div>The Energy Revolution System is presented as a beginner-friendly option for exploring DIY energy projects. Before starting, review the actual instructions, required equipment, installation process, and safety precautions to understand the level of technical knowledge needed.</div><div><br></div><div><b>5. Potential Benefits for Property Appeal</b></div><div><br></div><div>Energy efficiency and professionally installed renewable energy systems may appeal to prospective homebuyers who want to manage ongoing household expenses. Depending on the property and local market, suitable energy improvements may contribute to its overall appeal.</div><div><br></div><div>The Energy Revolution System may interest homeowners researching energy-related improvements. However, any effect on property value depends on the completed installation, equipment quality, applicable regulations, and buyer demand. An increase in property value is not guaranteed.</div><div><br></div><div><b>6. Understanding Energy Storage Options</b></div><div><br></div><div>Battery storage can make renewable electricity more flexible by allowing surplus power to be stored for later use. For example, a properly sized battery system may supply stored electricity when solar generation is unavailable.</div><div><br></div><div>The Energy Revolution System's description refers to energy storage, but buyers should confirm whether a physical battery is included or whether the product simply explains the relevant concepts. Backup performance depends on battery capacity, power requirements, and system configuration.</div><div><br></div><div><b>7. Better Awareness of Energy Consumption</b></div><div><br></div><div>Understanding how and when electricity is used can help households identify opportunities to improve energy efficiency. Monitoring tools, where available, can provide useful information about energy production and consumption.</div><div><br></div><div>The Energy Revolution System may help users explore energy-management concepts and consider ways to make informed decisions about electricity use. Verify whether the product includes actual monitoring software or hardware before expecting real-time tracking features.</div><div><br></div><div><b>8. Exploring Maintenance and Long-Term Practicality</b></div><div><br></div><div>Renewable energy equipment can provide long-term value when it is properly selected, installed, and maintained. However, different components have different maintenance requirements, operating lifespans, and replacement costs.</div><div><br></div><div>The Energy Revolution System may provide a starting point for understanding these considerations. Before investing in equipment, review its specifications, maintenance needs, warranty coverage, and estimated operating expenses to evaluate its long-term practicality.</div><div><br></div><div><b>9. Preparing for a More Renewable Energy Future</b></div><div><br></div><div>Renewable energy continues to be an important consideration for households looking for alternatives to conventional electricity. Learning about solar power, wind generation, energy storage, and electricity efficiency can help you make more informed decisions as your energy needs evolve.</div><div><br></div><div>The Energy Revolution System is aimed at people interested in exploring these concepts through a potentially accessible DIY approach. Whether you use it as a learning resource or as a starting point for a larger energy project, consider your household requirements, available space, budget, and local conditions before choosing a solution.</div><div><br></div><div>Overall, the Energy Revolution System may appeal to individuals who want to learn more about alternative energy and explore potential ways to manage electricity consumption. To determine its real-world value, verify exactly what is included, the equipment required, the total setup cost, and the practical limitations before making a purchase.</div></h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                    <div><b><br></b></div><ul>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
