          "_name": "image01",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"image01\" group=\"Image & Video\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n                    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"7\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\">\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n      <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n    </fieldset>\n    <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"image-wrapper mb-4\">\n          <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/the-science-behind-energy-revolution-system.webp\" alt=\"energy-revolution-graph\">\n        </div>\n        <h4 class=\"mbr-description mbr-fonts-style mb-3 align-center\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-description\">\n          <b>Stitching dreams, one thread at a time.</b>\n        </h4>\n        <p class=\"mbr-description mbr-fonts-style mb-0 align-center\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-description\">\n          Unleash your creativity and sew your way to endless possibilities.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "image01-44",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "vfh0EMOwTE",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#000000"
            }
          },
          "_name": "article12",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article12\" group=\"Article\">    \n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4 mt-0\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                <b>Framing time</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">The storytelling magic of photos\n                </h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">Renewable energy technologies are supported by decades of scientific research and real-world applications. Solar panels, wind turbines, and battery storage systems are widely used to generate electricity, improve energy flexibility, and reduce reliance on fossil fuels.<br><br>The Energy Revolution System references these established energy concepts. However, it is important to distinguish between scientific evidence supporting renewable energy technology in general and independent evidence verifying the specific performance of this particular product. The system's actual capabilities depend on its components, specifications, and implementation.<br><br><b>1. Solar Power Efficiency</b><br><br>Solar energy is one of the most widely researched renewable energy technologies. Photovoltaic panels convert sunlight into electricity, allowing homeowners and businesses to generate power without directly burning fossil fuels during operation.<br><br>According to research and resources published by the U.S. Department of Energy (DOE) and the National Renewable Energy Laboratory (NREL), solar panel performance depends on factors such as panel efficiency, sunlight intensity, temperature, shading, and installation conditions. Solar panels can also generate electricity on cloudy days, although production is generally lower than under direct sunlight.<br><br>The Energy Revolution System describes solar power as one of the energy sources users can explore. However, its actual solar-generation capacity and efficiency should be confirmed through verified product specifications and independent testing.<br><br><b>2. Understanding Wind Energy Performance</b><br><br>Wind power is another established renewable energy technology. Wind turbines convert the kinetic energy of moving air into electricity, making them a potential complement to solar power in locations with suitable wind conditions.<br><br>The U.S. Department of Energy's Wind Energy Technologies Office provides research and technical information on turbine performance, energy production, and the factors that influence wind power generation. Actual output varies with wind speed, turbine design, installation height, and local terrain.<br><br>For the Energy Revolution System, wind energy may be relevant to users exploring alternative electricity sources. Nevertheless, the effectiveness of any included or recommended turbine depends on its verified specifications and whether local wind conditions are suitable. Claims about the performance of a particular turbine require product-specific evidence.<br><br><b>3. The Role of Battery Energy Storage</b><br><br>Battery storage is an important part of many renewable energy installations because it allows electricity generated at one time to be used later. For example, a properly configured battery can store surplus solar electricity for use during the evening or when sunlight is limited.<br><br>Battery performance depends on several factors, including usable capacity, charging and discharging efficiency, operating temperature, battery chemistry, and degradation over time. Not all the electricity entering a battery is available for later use, so storage efficiency and system losses must be considered.<br><br>Organizations such as the International Renewable Energy Agency (IRENA) study the role of energy storage in supporting renewable electricity systems. This broader research supports the value of storage technology, but it does not independently establish that the Energy Revolution System includes a particular battery type or achieves a specific storage efficiency. Those details should be verified before purchase.<br><br><b>4. Renewable Energy, Energy Independence, and Sustainability</b><br><br>Renewable energy can help households reduce their reliance on electricity generated from fossil fuels. Depending on the energy source being replaced, the equipment used, and the local electricity mix, renewable generation may also reduce associated greenhouse gas emissions.<br><br>The Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change (IPCC) has extensively assessed the role of renewable energy and other measures in reducing emissions and addressing climate change.<br><br>The Energy Revolution System is presented as an option for people interested in exploring alternative energy solutions. However, the degree of energy independence or emissions reduction achieved depends on the system's actual generation capacity, household consumption, storage arrangements, and connection to the electricity grid.<br><br><b>5. Real-World Performance, Energy Savings, and Property Value</b><br><br>Real-world results are essential when evaluating any energy solution. Properly installed solar and wind systems can generate useful electricity, but their financial benefits vary considerably between households and locations.<br><br>Potential savings depend on equipment costs, installation expenses, electricity rates, energy production, maintenance, available incentives, and how much generated electricity can be used effectively. Claims of savings as high as 70% should not be treated as typical or guaranteed without reliable, independently verified evidence relevant to the specific installation.<br><br>Research has also examined the relationship between residential solar installations and property values. However, the effect varies according to factors such as location, ownership of the system, local housing demand, and installation quality. These general findings do not guarantee that purchasing the Energy Revolution System will increase a property's resale value.<br><br>Before relying on specific performance claims, look for documented installations, independently verified energy-output data, transparent cost comparisons, and clear product specifications.<br><br><b>What Does the Scientific Evidence Mean for Buyers?</b><br><br>Scientific research supports the underlying principles of solar power, wind generation, and battery storage. These technologies can offer practical benefits when the equipment is appropriately selected, installed, and maintained.<br><br>However, evidence supporting renewable energy in general should not be confused with proof that a particular product delivers every advertised result. Before purchasing the Energy Revolution System, review its actual deliverables, equipment requirements, independent testing, installation instructions, and realistic cost expectations.<br><br>Taking this approach can help you make an informed decision based on established science rather than relying solely on promotional claims.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
