          "_name": "features032",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features032\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n    <header>Card</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Images\" name=\"showImages\">\n    <select title=\"Columns\" name=\"columns\">\n      <option value=\"12\">1</option>\n      <option value=\"6\" selected>2</option>\n      <option value=\"4\">3</option>\n      <option value=\"3\">4</option>\n    </select>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Cards BG\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#edefeb\" selected>\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n      <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n    </fieldset>\n    <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 mb-5 content-head\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n        <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n          <b>Our Features</b>\n        </h3>\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n          Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Praesent vitae erat. Integer aliquam, lorem\n          vitae dapibus sollicitudin, nibh nisl egestas enim, ut dapibus odio augue tempus venenatis mi\n          semper.\n        </h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      \n      <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-lg-{{columns}} item-mb active\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n            <div class=\"img-wrapper mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showImages\">\n              <img class src=\"../_images/shop/shop3.jpg\" data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\">\n            </div>\n            <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\">\n              <b>Pros</b>\n            </h5>\n            <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\"><b>Beginner-Friendly Instructions<br></b>The system is described as offering step-by-step instructions and visual diagrams that may help beginners understand the assembly process more easily.<br><br><b>No Conventional Fuel Required</b><br>The product description highlights an alternative approach to energy generation without relying on conventional fuels such as gasoline. However, the actual operating method and energy requirements should be verified before purchase.<br><br><b>Potentially Lower Maintenance</b><br>A system with fewer moving parts may require less routine maintenance than some mechanical alternatives. Actual upkeep depends on the equipment, components, and operating conditions.<br><br><b>Flexible Expansion Options</b><br>The product information suggests that users may be able to expand the setup by adding compatible components. Confirm which upgrades are supported and whether additional equipment must be purchased separately.<br><br><b>Customer Support and Updates</b><br>The product description mentions customer assistance and lifetime updates. Buyers should verify the precise support terms, update availability, and any applicable conditions before ordering.<br><br><b>60-Day Money-Back Guarantee</b><br>The supplied information advertises a 60-day refund period, which may give buyers an opportunity to evaluate the purchase. Review the official refund policy carefully to understand the eligibility requirements, deadlines, and refund procedure.<br></p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-lg-{{columns}} item-mb\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n            <div class=\"img-wrapper mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showImages\">\n              <img class src=\"../_images/shop/shop2.jpg\" data-slide-to=\"2\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\">\n            </div>\n            <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\">\n              <b>Cons</b></h5>\n            <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\"><b>Available Through the Official Website</b><br>The product is described as being available directly through its official website. This may limit purchasing options, so verify the official seller, current price, and purchase terms before placing an order.<br><br><b>Discounted Pricing May Be Time-Limited</b><br>Promotional pricing may be available for a limited period, depending on the seller's current offer. Check the final checkout price and applicable terms rather than relying solely on countdowns or urgency-based promotions.<br></p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      \n      \n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
