          "_name": "article12",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article12\" group=\"Article\">    \n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4 mt-0\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                <b>Framing time</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">The storytelling magic of photos\n                </h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><br><br>Michael Garnett is identified as the creator of the Energy Revolution System. According to the supplied product description, he is an inventor and independent energy researcher with an interest in electrical experimentation and alternative energy concepts.<br><br>His work is described as drawing inspiration from the ideas associated with Nikola Tesla, including the bifilar coil, a type of coil winding arrangement studied in electrical engineering. The program aims to present these concepts in a more accessible format for people interested in DIY energy projects.<br><br>Rather than requiring users to begin with advanced technical knowledge, the Energy Revolution System is presented as a step-by-step guide intended to help beginners understand the underlying concepts and explore practical electrical projects. Its stated goal is to make learning about alternative energy more approachable without requiring a substantial initial investment in conventional energy equipment.<br><br>However, the creator's background, the program's technical claims, and its real-world energy-generation capabilities should be independently verified before purchase. Inspiration from established electrical concepts does not, by itself, demonstrate that a particular DIY design can generate usable net energy or provide household energy independence.<br><br><b>Mission</b><br>The stated mission of the Energy Revolution System is to help households explore affordable, accessible approaches to energy generation and understand potential alternatives to conventional electricity sources.<br><br><b>Approach</b><br>The program is described as providing step-by-step instructions and diagrams intended to simplify electrical concepts for DIY learners. Its goal is to help users understand the proposed design, materials, and assembly process. Buyers should review the actual guide and equipment requirements to determine what the project involves.<br><br><b>Customer Support</b><br>According to the supplied product information, purchases include lifetime guide updates and 60 days of email assistance. Before ordering, confirm these benefits, the applicable support terms, and the refund policy on the official website.<br><br>Overall, Michael Garnett is presented as the person behind the Energy Revolution System, with an emphasis on making DIY energy concepts easier to explore. As with any product involving electrical technology, reviewing independent evidence, realistic performance expectations, and safety requirements is essential before deciding whether it meets your needs.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
