          "_name": "features16",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features16\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card Color\" name=\"cardColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background3-2.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-lg\">\n                    <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>60-Days, 100% Money Back Guarantee</b></h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">According to the supplied product information, the Energy Revolution System comes with a 60-day money-back guarantee. This policy is intended to give buyers time to review the program, explore its instructions, and decide whether it meets their expectations.<br><br>Before placing your order, review the official refund policy to understand the eligibility requirements, applicable conditions, and steps involved in requesting a refund.<br><br>✅ <b>60-Day Evaluation Period:</b> The advertised guarantee gives you up to 60 days to evaluate your purchase, subject to the seller's refund terms.<br><br>✅ <b>Time to Review the Program:</b> Use the available period to examine the instructions, understand the proposed energy concepts, and determine whether the material suits your needs.<br><br>✅ <b>Customer Support:</b> The product description mentions customer assistance for setup questions and troubleshooting. Confirm the available support channels and response arrangements before purchasing.<br><br>✅ <b>Secure Checkout:</b> Check that the official checkout page uses a secure connection and clearly explains the payment process and purchase terms.<br><br>✅ <b>Added Purchase Reassurance:</b> A clearly defined refund policy can help reduce the uncertainty of buying a digital product, provided the seller honors the stated terms.<br><br>Is the Energy Revolution System Guarantee Worth Considering?<br><br>A 60-day money-back guarantee may provide additional reassurance when evaluating the Energy Revolution System. However, it is important to understand exactly what the policy covers and whether any conditions or exclusions apply.<br><br>Review the official terms before ordering, and keep your purchase confirmation and relevant correspondence in case you need to request a refund. Remember that a money-back guarantee does not independently verify the system's technical claims or guarantee electricity savings.<br></p>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\"><a class=\"btn btn-black\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" href=\"https://f4deegvc329y6t8dvffm5y0r3u.hop.clickbank.net\"><span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-paper-plane mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>TRY ENERGY REVOLUTION SYSTEM RISK FREE 60-DAYS</a></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}}\">\n                    <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                        <a href=\"https://f4deegvc329y6t8dvffm5y0r3u.hop.clickbank.net\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/2.webp\" alt=\"guarantee_badge\"></a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
