        {
          "_name": "content9",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content9\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stylized Counters\" name=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Square Counters\" name=\"squareCounters\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#b17643\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><div><span style=\"font-size: calc(1.175rem + 0.325 * ((100vw - 62rem) / 25));\">The Energy Revolution System is presented as an option for people interested in exploring alternative energy concepts, understanding electricity consumption, and learning about renewable power. Its described beginner-friendly approach may appeal to different types of users, although its suitability depends on individual energy needs, technical requirements, and the product's actual capabilities.</span><br></div><div><br></div><div>Here are the types of people who may be interested in the Energy Revolution System.</div></h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                    <ol>\n                        <li><b>Homeowners Looking to Manage Electricity Costs:&nbsp;</b><span style=\"font-size: calc(1.175rem + 0.325 * ((100vw - 62rem) / 25));\">If rising electricity bills are putting pressure on your household budget, exploring alternative energy options may be worthwhile. Learning about solar power, wind energy, and energy efficiency can help you understand potential ways to reduce dependence on grid electricity.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: calc(1.175rem + 0.325 * ((100vw - 62rem) / 25));\">The Energy Revolution System may appeal to homeowners who want to investigate DIY energy projects. Actual savings will depend on the equipment used, installation expenses, local conditions, and household electricity consumption.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: calc(1.175rem + 0.325 * ((100vw - 62rem) / 25));\"><b>Environmentally Conscious Individuals:</b>&nbsp;</span>People who want to make more sustainable lifestyle choices may be interested in learning how renewable energy works. Solar and wind technologies can generate electricity without directly burning fossil fuels during operation. The Energy Revolution System introduces concepts associated with alternative energy generation, making it a potential starting point for people who want to explore greener energy options. The environmental benefits depend on the technology and equipment ultimately used.</li><li><b>Small Business Owners Exploring Energy Alternatives:</b> Electricity is an important operating expense for many small businesses. Understanding energy consumption and investigating alternative power sources may help business owners identify opportunities to improve efficiency and manage costs. The Energy Revolution System may interest entrepreneurs who want to learn about DIY energy concepts. However, businesses with substantial electricity requirements should carefully evaluate system capacity, reliability, installation costs, and applicable electrical regulations before relying on an alternative energy solution.</li><li><b>People Concerned About Power Outages:</b> Households in areas affected by frequent power interruptions may want to investigate backup electricity options. Renewable energy equipment combined with appropriately sized battery storage can help provide backup power when the grid is unavailable. The Energy Revolution System may be relevant to people researching these possibilities. However, a reliable backup supply requires compatible equipment with sufficient generation and storage capacity. Confirm the system's actual capabilities rather than assuming it will provide uninterrupted electricity.</li><li><b>Property Owners Researching Renewable Energy Improvements:</b> Homeowners and property investors may be interested in energy efficiency improvements that appeal to environmentally conscious buyers. Depending on the installation and local market, suitable renewable energy systems may contribute to a property's appeal. The Energy Revolution System may serve as a starting point for researching alternative energy projects. Any potential increase in property value will depend on the completed installation, equipment quality, local buyer demand, and other market factors; increased resale value is not guaranteed.</li><li><b>Beginners Interested in DIY Energy Projects:</b> You don't necessarily need an advanced technical background to begin learning about renewable energy concepts. Clear instructions and well-organized educational materials can help beginners understand the basic principles behind energy generation and storage. The Energy Revolution System is described as a beginner-friendly resource for exploring these topics. Before starting a project, review the required materials, technical instructions, safety precautions, and potential additional costs. Electrical installations may require professional assistance.</li></ol>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".counter-container": {
              "ol": {
                "margin-bottom": "0",
                "li": {
                  "margin-bottom": "1rem"
                },
                "& when (@stylizedCounters)": {
                  "counter-reset": "myCounter",
                  "li": {
                    "list-style": "none",
                    "padding-left": "1rem",
                    "position": "relative",
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-40px",
                      "margin-top": "5px",
                      "counter-increment": "myCounter",
                      "content": "counter(myCounter)",
                      "line-height": "40px",
                      "transition": "all .2s",
                      "color": "contrast(@iconColor)",
                      "background": "@iconColor",
                      "width": "40px",
                      "height": "40px",
                      "border-radius": "50%",
                      "display": "flex",
                      "align-items": "center",
                      "justify-content": "center",
                      "& when (@squareCounters)": {
                        "border-radius": "0"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
