          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"list1\" group=\"List\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background':bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"mbr-switch-arrow, mobirise-icons2\">\t\n    <mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n\t\t<select title=\"Amount\" name=\"cardAmount\">\n\t\t\t<option value=\"1\">1</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"2\" selected>2</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"3\">3</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"4\">4</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"5\">5</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"6\">6</option>\n\t\t</select>\n\t\t<header>Color</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Item\" name=\"items\" value=\"#b17643\" selected>\n\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n\t\t</fieldset>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" checked condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.9\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-10 m-auto\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center mb-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-head\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mt-4 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFAQ</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"bootstrap-accordion\" class=\"panel-group accordionStyles accordion\" role=\"tablist\" aria-multiselectable=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingOne\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-semibold mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit, .mbr-iconfont\">Does the Energy Revolution System Include a Money-Back Guarantee?</h6>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-arrow-down\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"collapse1\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingOne\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">The supplied product information advertises a 60-day, 100% money-back guarantee. Before purchasing, review the official refund policy to confirm the eligibility requirements, deadlines, exclusions, and procedure for requesting a refund.<br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingOne\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-semibold mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit\">How Can I Order the Energy Revolution System?</h6>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-arrow-down\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"collapse2\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingOne\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">To purchase, visit the product's verified official website and review the current offer, included materials, pricing, and refund terms. If you decide to proceed, follow the checkout instructions and retain your order confirmation for future reference. Make sure the website is authentic before entering payment information.<br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingOne\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-semibold mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit\">Is it portable?</h6>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-arrow-down\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"collapse3\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingOne\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">Yesâ€”lightweight, compact, and quiet. Ideal for apartments, cabins, and RVs, and a dependable backup during outages.<br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingOne\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse4\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-semibold mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit\">Can it power large appliances?</h6>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-arrow-down\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"collapse4\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingOne\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">Start with essentials, then expand. With added modules and storage, you can support refrigerators, A/C units, and workshop tools.<br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingOne\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse5\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse5\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-semibold mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit\">How is it different from solar or wind?</h6>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-arrow-down\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"collapse5\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingOne\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">It uses Tesla-inspired electromagnetic principles that work day or night, in any weather. No panels or turbines required, and it's quiet and indoor-friendly.<br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 5\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingOne\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse6\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse6\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-semibold mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit\"><div></div></h6>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-arrow-down\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"collapse6\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingOne\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\"></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "list01-48",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "vfhacFsuwz",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            }
          },
          "_name": "content4",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content4\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"12\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>What Happens After You Click the “Buy Now” Button?</b></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">Getting started with the Energy Revolution System is presented as a straightforward process. After clicking the “Buy Now” button, you’ll be directed to the checkout page, where you can review the available purchase options and enter your payment information.<div><br></div><div>Once your purchase is completed, the supplied offer information states that you’ll receive access to the Energy Revolution System materials. Review the checkout details carefully before placing your order so you understand exactly what’s included.</div></h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "tLFFRV0vg2",
          "_anchor": "content4-z",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
              ".image-wrapper": {
                "margin-bottom": "1rem"
              }
            },
            ".row": {
              "flex-direction": "row-reverse"
            },
            "img": {
              "width": "100%"
            }
          },
          "_name": "image3",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"image3\" group=\"Images & Videos\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n                    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"8\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                    <a href=\"https://f4deegvc329y6t8dvffm5y0r3u.hop.clickbank.net\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/energy-revolution-system-checkout-page.webp\" alt=\"energy-revolution-secure-checkout\"></a>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-description mbr-fonts-style mt-2 align-center\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-description\"></p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
