          "_name": "content5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>Article Title</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>Is My Credit Card Information Safe?</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Your payment security matters whenever you purchase a digital product online. Before entering your details, make sure the checkout page uses a secure connection and review the seller’s payment and privacy policies.<br><br><b>Here’s what the Energy Revolution System purchase process is described as including:</b><br><br><b>Secure Checkout:</b> Complete your purchase through the designated checkout page. Check that the payment page uses HTTPS and that the seller provides clear privacy information.<br><br><b>Choose Your License:</b> Review the available single-license or multi-license options, including their prices and terms, before selecting the option that suits your needs.<br><br><b>Confirm Your Order:</b> Double-check your email address, selected package, and total payment amount before completing your purchase.<br><br><b>Access Your Materials:</b> According to the supplied offer information, buyers receive access to a members dashboard containing the manual, diagrams, materials lists, and advertised bonuses.<br><br><b>Follow the Instructions:</b> Use the provided materials to understand the proposed assembly process. Check the actual components required and follow appropriate electrical and construction safety precautions.<br><br><b>Video Walkthroughs:</b> The offer describes optional short videos intended to explain major steps. Confirm their availability and contents before purchasing.<br><br><b>Customer Support:</b> Email support is advertised for questions about troubleshooting and component substitutions. Review the available support terms and contact details.<br><br><b>Private Community:</b> A private forum is listed as a feature for sharing progress and exchanging information with other users. Confirm that community access is included in your selected package.<br><br><b>60-Day Money-Back Guarantee:</b> The offer advertises a 60-day refund policy. Read the official refund terms to understand eligibility, deadlines, and how to submit a request.<br><br><b>Lifetime Updates:</b> Lifetime updates are advertised as part of the offer. Check the purchase terms for details about what updates cover and whether any conditions apply.<br></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
